            "collapsible-row-content": "<p><strong>Study #1:</strong> <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24239838/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24239838/\"><strong>Immunomodulatory Effect of LC-Plasma on Human<br/>pDCs</strong></a></p><p><strong>Study #2: </strong><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26234407/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/26234407/\"><strong>Effects of Oral Intake of LC-Plasma on Influenza Symptoms</strong></a></p><p><strong>Study #3:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/287521111_Effects_of_the_beverage_containing_Lactococcus_lactis_subsp_Lactis_JCM5805_on_anti-viral_immune_responses_and_maintenance_of_physical_conditions_-_A_randomized_double-blind_placebo-controlled_parallel\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/287521111_Effects_of_the_beverage_containing_Lactococcus_lactis_subsp_Lactis_JCM5805_on_anti-viral_immune_responses_and_maintenance_of_physical_conditions_-_A_randomized_double-blind_placebo-controlled_parallel\"><strong>Effects of LC-Plasma<br/>on Antiviral Immune Response</strong></a></p><p><strong>Study #4: </strong><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/296884802_The_safety_evaluation_of_long-term_or_excessive_intake_of_the_beverage_containing_Lactococcus_lactis_subsp_lactis_JCM_5805_and_resistant_maltodextrin-a_randomized_double-blind_placebo-controlled_paral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/296884802_The_safety_evaluation_of_long-term_or_excessive_intake_of_the_beverage_containing_Lactococcus_lactis_subsp_lactis_JCM_5805_and_resistant_maltodextrin-a_randomized_double-blind_placebo-controlled_paral\"><strong>Long-Term Use and Excessive Intake Trials (Safety Data)</strong></a></p>",
